			"Message": "chore(Wind): Untrack and ignore tsconfig.tsbuildinfo (TypeScript incremental build cache)\n\nAdd explicit .gitignore entry for tsconfig.tsbuildinfo — the TypeScript incremental compilation cache file produced by tsc's --incremental flag. This binary-adjacent JSON file changes on every build and should never be version-controlled.\n\nContinues the ongoing cleanup of build artifacts in the Wind submodule (previously: *.d.ts, *.d.ts.map, Source/ESBuild.js, *Generated.ts).",
